    "chunk_text": "On \u00feissum \u00e6restan l\u00e6cecr\u00e6ftum gewritene sint l\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 eallum heafdes untrymnessum. Murra hatte wyrt, gegnid on mortere \u00fe\u00e6tte pening gewege, do steap fulne wines to wose symre Wi\u00f0 heafod w\u00e6rce genim rudan & wermod, gecnuwa & meng wi\u00fe eced & ele, aseoh \u00feurh cla\u00f0, Wi\u00f0 \u00feon ilcan genim betonican & pipor, gegnid swi\u00f0e tog\u00e6dere, l\u00e6t ane niht hangian on cla\u00f0e, smire Wi\u00f0 heafod w\u00e6rce betan wyrttruman gecnuwa wi\u00f0 hunig, awring, do \u00fe\u00e6t seaw on neb & ongean H\u00e6bbe him \u00e6r on mu\u00fee ele o\u00fe\u00fee buteran & \u00feonne uplang aslitte hnigie for\u00f0 l\u00e6te flowan of \u00feam Do swa gelome o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t hit cl\u00e6ne sie. Wi\u00f0 heafod w\u00e6rce genim hamwyrt ni\u00feewearde, gecnuwa, lege on ceald w\u00e6ter, gnid swi\u00f0e o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t Wi\u00fe heafod w\u00e6rce genim heah heolo\u00fean & grunde swelgean & fencersan & gitrifan, wel on w\u00e6tere, Wi\u00f0 heafod ece genim sealh & ele, do ahsan, gewyrc \u00feonne to slypan, do to hymlican & eofor \u00ferotan Wi\u00fe heafod ece hundes heafod geb\u00e6rn to ahsan & sni\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heafod, lege on. Wi\u00f0 heafod w\u00e6rce genim efelastan, gecnua on ceald w\u00e6ter, gnid betweoh handum & gecnuwa Wi\u00fe heafod ece genim hofan & win & eced, geswet mid hunige & smire mid. Wi\u00fe",
